Server init.
>> a := Blob novo: 4.
a bytes: ( Lista novo ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob novo: 4.
b bytes: ( Lista novo ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a novo.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Saída escribir: ( a ^ c ), salto-de-liña. } capturar: { :e Saída escribir: e, salto-de-liña. }, iniciar.
a liberar.
b liberar.
